":"WordRidden from Brighton, United Kingdom","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Marx_Bros_Cafe_-_Caesar_salad_(2526751153).jpg"}},{"id":"anchorage_wv_bear_tooth_theatrepub","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Bear Tooth Theatrepub","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":61.19608,"lng":-149.90704},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_bear_tooth_theatrepub","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.beartoothak.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["beartooththeatrepub","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"10:30","close":"23:00"},null,{"open":"11:30","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Closed Sat"},"summary":"A wonderful pizza location, similar to the Moose's Tooth described below (although the menu differs a bit). It also features a movie theater in which you can eat dinner (they deliver it right to your seat) and imbibe from the wide selection of microbrews and wines. It mainly plays art house films and those that have been released for some time. It's a great place to spend an evening before taking ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_bernie_s_bungalow_lounge","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Bernie's Bungalow Lounge","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":61.21598,"lng":-149.89001},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_bernie_s_bungalow_lounge","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.bernieslounge.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["berniesbungalowlounge","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"This is a fashionable and friendly \"martini-and-cigar\" type of place. Good place to sit outside on the lawn in the summer, or to go upstairs to the Paradise Room for a fancy place to have a drink (although the upstairs is often booked for private gatherings). It's popular with well-dressed young people and businesspeople (during the daytime). The evening crowd is generally younger and the bar is e","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_moose_s_tooth_pub_and_pizzeria","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Moose's Tooth Pub and Pizzeria","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":61.1905,"lng":-149.869},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_moose_s_tooth_pub_and_pizzeria","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://moosestooth.net/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["moosestoothpubandpizzeria","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Brews their own beer and makes some fantastic pizza (all-ages welcome). Good atmosphere and walls covered with memorabilia about Alaska and beer. Can be busy. Frequently has outdoor concerts during the summer on the first Thursday of every month (\"first tap\" is age 21+). Must-go if you like beer. Has vegetarian selections. Medium prices; it's possible to save by splitting a large pizza. Menu and b","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_solstice_bar_grill","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Solstice Bar & Grill","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":61.21732,"lng":-149.89604},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_solstice_bar_grill","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["solsticebargrill","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"While not as popular as Glacier BrewHouse, Solstice Bar & Grill offers meals of a similar quality for a slightly cheaper price in the lobby level of the Westmark Hotel (almost directly across from the BrewHouse). This restaurant can get quite busy during the summer breakfast and dinner times, as Westmark plays host to a number of cruise line guests (its parent company is Holland America Line).","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_snow_city_cafe","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Snow City Cafe","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":61.21847,"lng":-149.90341},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_snow_city_cafe","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.snowcitycafe.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["snowcitycafe","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Open for breakfast and lunch only, except on Wednesdays when there is an excellent Irish jam (and sometimes dance!) from 7-11PM. There is often a long wait for a table and for good reason, food is fresh and affordable; breakfast is available all day and there are plenty of hearty fares for the health-conscious. If you're not health-conscious, the macaroni and cheese is to die for!","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_chilkoot_charlie_s","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Chilkoot Charlie's","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":61.19817,"lng":-149.90492},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_chilkoot_charlie_s","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.koots.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["chilkootcharlies","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"This is the largest bar within about 1,400 miles (2200 km). It's a huge spot that is always busy on weekends. The outside facade is deceptively small - there is a map on their website to navigate through all 10 or more bars. There is usually at least one band playing every night (and usually a cover charge). Popular place to pick up dates, if you can hear above the noise.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_49th_state_brewing_company","areaId":"anchorage","name":"49th State Brewing Company","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":61.21951,"lng":-149.89639},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_49th_state_brewing_company","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.49statebrewing.com","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["49thstatebrewingcompany","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Popular micro-brewery on the edge of downtown Anchorage. Good micro beers and decent pub food. Often have live entertainment. A treat is to sit out on the second floor landing on a sunny afternoon with excellent views of Cook Inlet and the Port of Anchorage. Sometimes you can see military aircraft doing training runs into Elmendorf Air Force Base.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_arctic_roadrunner","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Arctic Roadrunner","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":61.17274,"lng":-149.8689},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_arctic_roadrunner","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://arcticroadrunner64.wixsite.com/arctic-roadrunner","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["arcticroadrunner","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Second location at 2477 Arctic Blvd, . An Alaskan institution and consistently voted Anchorage's best burger. Kitschy Alaskana on the walls, including plaques and portraits of longtime Alaskans and longtime Arctic Roadrunner customers. Also try the halibut burger and homemade onion ring pieces. Cash only; \"no checks since 1972.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_simon_and_seafort_s","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Simon and Seafort's","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":61.21798,"lng":-149.90438},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_simon_and_seafort_s","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.simonandseaforts.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["simonandseaforts","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Semi-fancy seafood restaurant and bar. On the expensive side, but it's worth it to get some of the best seafood in Alaska (and being Anchorage, there's no dress code). They also have excellent non-seafood selections and a great lunch menu. You can also see the sunset over the water by the window. Menus online.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_white_spot_cafe","areaId":"anchorage","name":"White Spot Cafe","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":61.21868,"lng":-149.88378},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_white_spot_cafe","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["whitespotcafe","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"The place is not much more than a small kitchen and a counter with room for 10 patrons. Arguably better burgers and definitely better halibut sandwiches than Arctic Roadrunner. Study the menu carefully before daring to order, or Sheri will put you in your place. The food is way worth the attitude, though.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_orso_ristorante","areaId":"anchorage","name":"ORSO Ristorante","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":61.21765,"lng":-149.89572},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_orso_ristorante","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://orsoalaska.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["orsoristorante","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Next to and owned by the same company as Glacier BrewHouse, this restaurant offers higher-priced meals inspired by traditional Italian fare. In the same block as a number of art galleries and smaller boutique shops, one can keep occupied while waiting (which in the summer season, is typical).","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_gwennie_s","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Gwennie's","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":61.18188,"lng":-149.93273},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_gwennie_s","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.gwenniesoldalaskarestaurant.top/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["gwenniesanchorage","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"An Alaskan institution; must be seen to be understood. Down home Americana meets Alaska (think sourdough pancakes and reindeer sausage). Extremely touristy but also popular with the locals for good prices and big portions. Old-time Alaskan rusty things hanging on the walls.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_darwin_s_theory","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Darwin's Theory","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":61.21801,"lng":-149.89576},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_darwin_s_theory","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.alaska.net/~thndrths/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["darwinstheory","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"A quintessential \"dive bar,\" Darwin's is popular with the locals. If you're interested in avoiding the generic tourist watering holes, Darwin's will wet your whistle. It's just a basic corner bar. Ask to see the photo book.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_humpy_s_great_alaskan_alehouse","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Humpy's Great Alaskan Alehouse","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":61.21634,"lng":-149.89408},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_humpy_s_great_alaskan_alehouse","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.humpysalaska.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["humpysgreatalaskanalehouse","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Humpy's has dozens of beers on tap and a great pub food selection (esp. seafood) until midnight. It's popular with just about everyone. Beer-battered halibut—yum!","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"},{"id":"anchorage_wv_time_out_lounge","areaId":"anchorage","name":"Time Out Lounge","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":61.17911,"lng":-149.86919},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"anchorage_wv_time_out_lounge","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["timeoutlounge","anchorage"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"10:00","close":"23:59"}]},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Longstanding cocktail bar with a welcoming atmosphere. Karaoke every Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday. Has darts, live music, and pool.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Anchorage"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}